title: Personal Loan Application
submit_url: https://httpbin.org/post
success_message: Thank you! Your loan application has been submitted for review. You will receive a confirmation email shortly.
---

# Personal Information

< Please provide your legal name and contact details exactly as they appear on your government-issued ID.

[text(placeholder="John", min=1, max=50): first_name] First Name *
[text(placeholder="Doe", min=1, max=50): last_name] Last Name *
[date: date_of_birth] Date of Birth *
[ssn: social_security_number] Social Security Number *
[email(placeholder="john@example.com"): email] Email Address *
[phone(placeholder="(555) 123-4567"): phone] Phone Number *

