# Employment & Income

< Tell us about your current employment and income.

[select: employment_status] Employment Status *
- Employed full-time
- Employed part-time
- Self-employed
- Retired
- Student
- Unemployed

?if employment_status = "Employed full-time"
[text(placeholder="Acme Corporation"): employer_name] Employer Name *
[text(placeholder="Software Engineer"): job_title] Job Title *
[number(min=0): years_employed] Years at Current Employer *
[currency(placeholder="75000"): annual_salary] Annual Salary ($) *
?endif

?if employment_status = "Employed part-time"
[text(placeholder="Acme Corporation"): employer_name] Employer Name *
[currency(placeholder="35000"): annual_salary] Annual Income ($) *
?endif

?if employment_status = "Self-employed"
[text(placeholder="My Business LLC"): business_name] Business Name *
[number(min=0): years_in_business] Years in Business *
[currency(placeholder="90000"): annual_revenue] Annual Revenue ($) *
?endif

?if employment_status = "Retired"
[currency(placeholder="50000"): retirement_income] Annual Retirement Income ($) *
?endif

# Loan Details

< How much would you like to borrow and for what purpose?

| Term | APR | Monthly Payment (per $10,000) |
|------|:---:|------------------------------:|
| 12 months | 5.99% | $860.66 |
| 24 months | 6.49% | $444.85 |
| 36 months | 6.99% | $308.29 |
| 48 months | 7.49% | $241.79 |
| 60 months | 7.99% | $202.76 |

[currency(placeholder="10000", min=1000, max=100000): loan_amount] Loan Amount ($) *
[select: loan_purpose] Loan Purpose *
- Debt consolidation
- Home improvement
- Major purchase
- Medical expenses
- Vehicle purchase
- Education
- Business
- Other

[select: loan_term] Preferred Loan Term *
- 12 months
- 24 months
- 36 months
- 48 months
- 60 months

?toggle Additional Details (Optional)
[text: referral_code] Referral Code
[textarea: loan_notes] Additional Notes or Comments
?endtoggle

# Review & Consent

< Please review your information and **agree to the following** before submitting.

By submitting this application, you acknowledge that:

- All information provided is **true and accurate**
- You authorize a *soft credit inquiry* that will **not** affect your credit score
- Your data will be processed according to our [Privacy Policy](https://example.com/privacy)

***Important:*** Incomplete applications will be automatically declined.

> **Note:** Your data will be submitted as a JSON payload in the following format:

```json
{
  "first_name": "John",
  "last_name": "Doe",
  "loan_amount": 10000,
  "loan_purpose": "Home improvement"
}
```

[checkbox: certify_accurate] I certify that all information provided in this application is true, complete, and accurate to the best of my knowledge *
[checkbox: authorize_credit_check] I authorize the lender to obtain my credit report for the purpose of evaluating this application *
[checkbox: agree_terms] I have read and agree to the [Terms of Service](https://example.com/terms) and [Privacy Policy](https://example.com/privacy) *
[checkbox: agree_electronic] I consent to receive communications electronically *
